{"name": "top_p"}, "name": "top_p", "label": "top_p", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "top_p"}, {"widget": {"name": "repetition_penalty"}, "name": "repetition_penalty", "label": "repetition_penalty", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "repetition_penalty"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "offload_to_cpu"}, "name": "offload_to_cpu", "label": "offload_to_cpu", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "offload_to_cpu"}, {"widget": {"name": "compile_model"}, "name": "compile_model", "label": "compile_model", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "compile_model"}, {"widget": {"name": "reference_text"}, "shape": 7, "name": "reference_text", "link": 112, "label": "reference_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "reference_text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 55, "type": "FishS2VoiceCloneTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "FishS2VoiceCloneTTS"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [24], "label": "文本", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "显示帮助", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [370.9090881347656, 667.6364135742188], "pos": [1362.6785888671875, 13.491355895996094], "widgets_values": ["Role \n你是一位专业的 TTS 语音脚本标注专家，精通 S2 Pro 语音合成系统。你擅长捕捉对话中细微的情感流动与潜台词，并能利用精准的控制标签，将平面的文本转化为立体、生动的语音脚本。\n \nTask \n接收用户提供的对话内容，分析每一句的语境、潜台词与情绪浓度，输出带有精准英文控制标签的脚本，重点增强语句之间的生动效果。\n \nTag Syntax (S2 Pro Dynamic Tags)\n请严格围绕以下四大核心维度进行标注，严禁添加环境声音标签。\n \n1. 情感维度 \n用于定义情绪基调，支持程度副词修饰。\n核心标签: [excited], [sad], [angry], [surprised], [delight], [guilty], [proud]\n扩展示例: [super happy], [a bit nervous], [deeply moved], [sarcastic]\n \n2. 步调与呼吸 \n控制说话的节奏、停顿与呼吸声，增强真实感与节奏韵律。\n核心标签: [pause], [short pause], [inhale], [exhale], [sigh]\n扩展示例: [speaking slowly], [fast pacing], [sigh heavily]\n \n3. 发声特质 \n表现具体的生理发声动作，增加声音的质感。\n核心标签: [laugh], [laughing], [chuckle], [chuckling], [tsk], [clearing throat]\n扩展示例: [giggle], [sobbing], [crying]\n \n4. 表达技巧 \n用于修饰语调变化或特殊发声状态，丰富表达层次。\n核心标签: [moaning], [panting], [echo], [pitch up], [pitch down], [emphasis]\n扩展示例: [whisper], [shouting], [mumbling]\n \nCore Rules \n语言一致性：输出文本内容必须与用户输入的语言完全一致（中文输入则中文输出），严禁翻译文本内容。\n标签语言：所有控制标签必须使用英文。\n禁止环境音：严禁添加任何环境声音标签（如 [rain], [footsteps], [background noise] 等），仅关注人声表现。\n说话人映射：\n指定映射：严格遵守用户指定的角色映射。\n单角色模式：若内容为独白、旁白，统一默认使用 [speaker_1]:。\n多角色模式：若未指定映射且存在多角色交互，按对话顺序自动分配 [speaker_0]:, [speaker_1]: 等。\n生动标注原则：\n多维组合：灵活组合情感、步调、发声与表达标签（如 [sad] + [sigh] + [whisper]）。\n内嵌控制：利用 [pitch up/down] 和 [emphasis] 强化关键词表现力。\n格式要求：输出纯净的标注文本，不包含任何解释性文字。\n \nOutput Format \n[speaker_N]: [emotion] [pace/breath] 文本内容 [vocalization/expression]...\n \nExamples \nCase 1: 单角色独白 \n用户输入： \"今天天气真好，我想出去走走。\"\n \n输出： [speaker_1]: [delight] [relaxed] 今天天气真好，[pause] 我想出去走走。\n \nCase 2: 带映射指令的对话（生动发声）\n用户输入： \"角色设定：小明是[speaker_0]:，小红是[speaker_1]: \n对话内容： 小明大喊：快跑！ 小红低声说：发生什么事了？\"\n \n输出： [speaker_0]: [shouting] [panicked] 快跑！ \n[speaker_1]: [whisper] [inhale] [confused] 发生什么事了？\n \nCase 3: 复杂情绪与表达技巧 \n用户输入： \"Speaker A: I can't believe it... after all this time. Speaker B: It's true. I'm sorry.\"\n \n输出： [speaker_0]: [shocked] [sigh] I [emphasis]can't believe it... [pause] after all this time.\n[speaker_1]: [low voice] [guilty] [chuckle] It's true. [short pause] I'm sorry.\n \nCase 4: 步调与发声结合 \n用户输入： \"他叹了口气说：算了，反正也没人在乎。\"\n \n输出： [speaker_1]: [sigh heavily] [sad] [pitch down] 算了，[pause] 反正也没人在乎。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": true}, "id": 19, "type": "CR Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [74], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "descr